    {
      "name": "Deployment wiring",
      "kind": "composition",
      "path": "src/agent_harness/api/serve.py",
      "reads": "build_application 依次构建 DeepSeekProvider、LangfuseTelemetry(settings.langfuse)（None 时不建）、_repository_explorer(settings)（只在 PRALE_TOOLS 含 repository_explore 时建，需要 PRALE_REPOSITORY_INDEX_DIR 且在 checkout 之外），再 create_builtin_tools(settings.project_root, repository_explorer=explorer) 并按 settings.tools 过滤。",
